### Upate Product By ID
PATCH {{base_url}}/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Talif",
    "category_slug": "human",
    "unit": "gram",
    "description": "i'm not robot",
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "variant": "2",
    "variant_detail": [
        {
        "stock": 111,
        "weight": 111,
        "product_image": "https://nmfsuaxoneftocigbbze.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/grocery-delivery/public/uploads/a0497eb5-86ed-4ced-a5f6-e95069720d1d_1751899498.jpg",
        "sale_price": 70000,
        "reguler_price": 65000
        }
    ]
}

### Get All Product Admin   
GET {{base_url}}?search=&orderBy=name&orderType=asc&page=1&limit=10&categorySlug=&startPrice=&endPrice=&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}


### Get Product By ID
GET {{base_url}}/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}

### Delete Product By ID
DELETE {{base_url}}/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}

### Create product
